        { "The accent groove of hats, shaker, ride and tambourine: the offbeat sings, the 16ths are softer (0%: flat)", "Il groove degli accenti di hi-hat, shaker, ride e tambourine: il levare canta, i 16esimi sono più piano (0%: piatto)", "El groove de acentos de hi-hats, shaker, ride y tambourine: el contratiempo canta, los semicorcheas más suaves (0%: plano)", "Le groove d'accents des hi-hats, shaker, ride et tambourine : le contretemps chante, les doubles croches plus douces (0% : plat)", "Der Akzent-Groove von Hi-Hats, Shaker, Ride und Tambourine: der Offbeat singt, die 16tel sind leiser (0%: flach)", "O groove de acentos de hi-hats, shaker, ride e tambourine: o contratempo canta, as semicolcheias mais suaves (0%: plano)" },
